WEBVTT

00:28.907 --> 00:31.597
<b>Jaadugar</b>

01:51.407 --> 01:56.407
<b>An Enduring Flame</b>

02:22.647 --> 02:26.317
<b>Spring, A.D. 1221
Taloqan</b>

02:28.177 --> 02:30.467
<b>Fourth Prince
Tolui</b>

02:32.927 --> 02:34.987
<b>Third Prince
Ögedei</b>

02:35.407 --> 02:37.407
<b>Second Prince
Chagatai</b>

02:38.197 --> 02:40.157
<b>First Prince
Jochi</b>

07:46.177 --> 07:47.177
<i>Tumen commander.</i>

07:47.427 --> 07:50.927
<i>This is the young lady I spoke of.</i>

07:51.517 --> 07:53.267
<i>Oh, I'm her interpreter, Shira.</i>

07:53.637 --> 07:56.147
<i>Pleased to make your acquaintance.</i>

08:37.437 --> 08:39.147
<i>Greetings, scholar's daughter!</i>

08:40.107 --> 08:42.527
<i>Glad to see you're still alive.</i>

08:42.857 --> 08:47.977
<i>"Greetings, scholar's daughter! Glad to see
you're still alive," says His Highness.</i>

08:54.157 --> 08:56.577
<i>Yes, you seem much more obedient now.</i>

08:57.077 --> 08:57.707
<i>Commendable.</i>

08:59.877 --> 09:01.587
<i>Have you been told the details?</i>

09:02.127 --> 09:04.417
<i>I want you to wait on my wife
and explain that book to her.</i>

09:04.757 --> 09:06.217
<i>She'll surely be delighted.</i>

09:07.177 --> 09:08.507
<i>Oh, right. What's your name?</i>

20:36.447 --> 20:39.807
<b>Several Months Later</b>

21:53.167 --> 21:57.347
<b>First Wife of Tolui
Sorghaghtani Beki</b>

23:38.067 --> 23:43.257
<b>Otchigin</b>
